    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis is a dataset released as a part of the Bird\u2019s-Eye project, a collaboration between Pula and Tetra Tech under the Enabling Crop Analytics at Scale Project. This work, funded by the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation, is meant to foster the collection of Ground truth georeferenced Agriculture labelled datasets that would improve predictive analytics in smallholder agriculture, through the use of Artificial intelligence and Machine Learning (AI/ML) and satellite imagery.\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [ECAAS Project](https://ecass-project-documentation.readthedocs.io/en/latest/modules/data_access.html#data-access)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [PULA](https://www.pula-advisors.com/)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** GPL-2.0-or-later\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2022\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |"
  },
